text = "Programmer
ACottontail

Artist
Retr0headphones

Writer
Retr0headphones

Special thanks to our Voice Actors!

Narrator - Hannah Chapin

Lady Sanguina - Hannah Chapin

Nitrus - Hannah Chapin

Rowan Hayes - Colin C

Kal - Colin C

Astrid - Kaylee Cimins

The Best - Cheesedino

Corn Gun Guy - Eight

Additional Programming:
2D Platformer Kit by Kenny
Knockback Script by MakerTech
Hue shift shader by McSpider

Composers

Xia 
(Main Menu, Boss Battle, Forest, and Facility)

Spadster 
(Cathedral)

Purgatory Garden
 (Nitrus’s theme)



What will last, 

and what people will remember, 

are the things made by the ones who decided. 

It may not be perfect, 

but I’m going to make something today.






Thank you for playing."
